ebraicJacobian/RiemannRoch/Adelic/Cokernel.lean\\\",\\n    \\\"line\\\": 378,\\n    \\\"score\\\": 20.1416\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"TruncExpCech.truncExpCechKernelAddEquiv\\\",\\n    \\\"kind\\\": \\\"def\\\",\\n    \\\"signature\\\": \\\"noncomputable def truncExpCechKernelAddEquiv (\\\\u03c1\\\\u2081 : A\\\\u2081 \\\\u2192+* B) (\\\\u03c1\\\\u2082 : A\\\\u2082 \\\\u2192+* B) : B \\\\u29f8 cechCoboundaryAdd \\\\u03c1\\\\u2081 \\\\u03c1\\\\u2082 \\\\u2243+ Additive (cechUnitsReduction \\\\u03c1\\\\u2081 \\\\u03c1\\\\u2082).ker\\\",\\n    \\\"doc\\\": \\\"**The truncated-exponential kernel computation** (Kleiman \\\\u00a75 Thm 5.11, cocycle leg, algebra layer): for a two-chart datum `\\\\u03c1\\\\u2081 : A\\\\u2081 \\\\u2192+* B`, `\\\\u03c1\\\\u2082 : A\\\\u2082 \\\\u2192+* B`, the truncated exponential `b \\\\u21a6 [1 + b \\\\u03b5]` induces an additive equivalence  ``` B \\\\u29f8 (\\\\u03c1\\\\u2081(A\\\\u2081) + \\\\u03c1\\\\u2082(A\\\\u2082))  \\\\u2243+  ker( \\\\u021e\\\\u00b9\\\\u02e3(B[\\\\u03b5]) \\\\u2192* \\\\u021e\\\\u00b9\\\\u02e3(B) ) ```  from the two-cover \\\\u010cech cokernel (the `AlgebraicGeometry.TwoCover.H1Cok` carrier shape \\\\u2014 `H\\\\u00b9(C, \\\\ud835\\\\udcaa_C)` for the section rings of a 2-affine cover of a curve) onto the kernel of the dual-number \\\\u010cech-units reduction (the two-chart `ker(Pic(C_\\\\u03b5) \\\\u2192 Pic(C))`). Well-definedness and injectivity are `mk_truncExpUnit_eq_one_iff`; surjectivity is `exists_mk_truncExpUnit_of_cechUnitsReduction_eq_one`; additivity is the truncated-exponential functional equation `truncExpUnit_add`.\\\",\\n    \\\"library\\\": \\\"Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild\\\",\\n    \\\"file\\\": \\\"MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild/AlgebraicJacobian/Tangent/TruncExpCech.lean\\\",\\n    \\\"line\\\": 308,\\n    \\\"score\\\": 20.1186\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"AlgebraicGeometry.TwoCover.h1AddEquivTruncExpCechKernel\\\",\\n    \\\"kind\\\": \\\"def\\\",\\n    \\\"signature\\\": \\\"noncomputable def h1AddEquivTruncExpCechKernel (hcov : U\\\\u2080 \\\\u2294 U\\\\u2081 = \\\\u22a4) (hU\\\\u2080 : IsAffineOpen U\\\\u2080) (hU\\\\u2081 : IsAffineOpen U\\\\u2081) : Sheaf.HModule (X.moduleKSheaf k) 1 \\\\u2243+ Additive (unitsReduction X U\\\\u2080 U\\\\u2081).ker\\\",\\n    \\\"doc\\\": \\\"**The truncated-exponential \\\\u010cech kernel computation of `H\\\\u00b9`** (Kleiman \\\\u00a75 Thm 5.11, cocycle leg, carrier form \\\\u2014 W5-T2 keystone): for a scheme `X` over `Spec k` and two affine opens `U\\\\u2080 \\\\u2294 U\\\\u2081 = \\\\u22a4`, the degree-one cohomology of the structure sheaf is additively the kernel of the dual-number \\\\u010cech-units reduction of the cover:  ``` H\\\\u00b9\\\\u2096(X, \\\\ud835\\\\udcaa)  \\\\u2243+  ker( \\\\u021e\\\\u00b9\\\\u02e3(\\\\u0393(U\\\\u2080 \\\\u2293 U\\\\u2081)[\\\\u03b5]) \\\\u2192* \\\\u021e\\\\u00b9\\\\u02e3(\\\\u0393(U\\\\u2080 \\\\u2293 U\\\\u2081)) ) ```  \\\\u2014 the two-cover \\\\u010cech form of `H\\\\u00b9(C, \\\\ud835\\\\udcaa_C) \\\\u2245 ker(Pic(C_\\\\u03b5) \\\\u2192 Pic(C))`. Composite of the landed `h1CokEquiv`, the carrier translation `h1CokAddEquivCechQuot`, and the engine `TruncExpCech.truncExpCechKernelAddEquiv`. On generators: `delta s \\\\u21a6 truncExpClass s` (`h1AddEquivTruncExpCechKernel_delta`). Additive only, BY DESIGN \\\\u2014 see the module docstring for the `k`-action interface (`mumfordScaling` equivariance).\\\",\\n    \\\"library\\\": \\\"Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild\\\",\\n    \\\"file\\\": \\\"MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild/AlgebraicJacobian/Tangent/TruncExpCechH1.lean\\\",\\n    \\\"line\\\": 281,\\n    \\\"score\\\": 20.0941\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"AlgebraicGeometry.AffAdaptation.ThetaGlobalSections\\\",\\n    \\\"kind\\\": \\\"abbrev\\\",\\n    \\\"signature\\\": \\\"noncomputable abbrev ThetaGlobalSections (_A : AffAdaptation D d) (a : \\\\u2115) : Type u\\\",\\n    \\\"doc\\\": \\\"Gl