riction of `x` (`dCoeffSectionsLinearEquiv_mk_one`) and intertwines the \\\\u010cech coface with the presheaf restriction (`dCoeffSectionsLinearEquiv_dCoface`).\\\",\\n    \\\"library\\\": \\\"Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge\\\",\\n    \\\"file\\\": \\\"MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge/AlgebraicJacobian/Cohomology/CechCoboundarySplitting.lean\\\",\\n    \\\"line\\\": 220,\\n    \\\"score\\\": 19.9332\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"AlgebraicGeometry.module_finite_top_of_gammaSpecTop\\\",\\n    \\\"kind\\\": \\\"theorem\\\",\\n    \\\"signature\\\": \\\"theorem module_finite_top_of_gammaSpecTop {R : CommRingCat.{u}} (M : (Spec R).Modules) (h : Module.Finite \\\\u0393(Spec R, (\\\\u22a4 : (Spec R).Opens)) \\\\u0393(M, (\\\\u22a4 : (Spec R).Opens))) : Module.Finite R \\\\u0393(M, (\\\\u22a4 : (Spec R).Opens))\\\",\\n    \\\"doc\\\": \\\"**Finiteness of global sections descends along `\\\\u0393SpecIso`**: a module on `Spec R` whose global sections are finite over `\\\\u0393(Spec R, \\\\u22a4)` has global sections finite over `R`, the two actions differing by the ring isomorphism `\\\\u0393SpecIso`.\\\",\\n    \\\"library\\\": \\\"Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge\\\",\\n    \\\"file\\\": \\\"MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge/AlgebraicJacobian/Picard/RigidPushforwardP1Sheaf.lean\\\",\\n    \\\"line\\\": 360,\\n    \\\"score\\\": 19.8372\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"AlgebraicGeometry.IsAffineOpen.exists_dDiff_eq_of_dDiff_eq_zero\\\",\\n    \\\"kind\\\": \\\"theorem\\\",\\n    \\\"signature\\\": \\\"theorem IsAffineOpen.exists_dDiff_eq_of_dDiff_eq_zero (hU : IsAffineOpen U) {\\\\u03b9 : Type*} [Finite \\\\u03b9] (g : \\\\u03b9 \\\\u2192 \\\\u0393(X, U)) (hcov : (\\\\u2a06 i, X.basicOpen (g i)) = U) (M : Type u) [AddCommGroup M] [Module \\\\u21a5\\\\u0393(X, U) M] (u : \\\\u2200 \\\\u03c3 : Fin 2 \\\\u2192 \\\\u03b9, SectionCechModule.dCoeff g M \\\\u03c3) (hu : SectionCechModule.dDiff g M 2 u = 0) : \\\\u2203 t : \\\\u2200 \\\\u03c3 : Fin 1 \\\\u2192 